To: Marta Kowalska
Subject: Re: Customs migration to DMS - plan, tests and go-live

Thank you for your request. We can offer the end-to-end test window on 4, 5 a=
nd 6 November. We expect at least 20 declarations in total from each declaran=
t, covering exports, amendments and at least one rejection scenario. Please s=
end us the list of test declarations (local reference, goods items, expected =
result) one week before the window. Rejections are returned on the same day w=
ith an error code, so you can correct and resubmit within the window.

Best regards,
Customs test team
Dutch customs authority, test coordination

